	// active member of workspace_id. Members may invite members; admins may invite
	// either role. Gated on brent:write.
	CreateInvitation(context.Context, *connect.Request[sdp_go.CreateInvitationRequest]) (*connect.Response[sdp_go.CreateInvitationResponse], error)
	// Creates one single-use invitation per email in a single call, all with the
	// same role, returning one result per email so a partial failure (e.g. one
	// duplicate among several) never aborts the rest. The caller must be an active
	// member of workspace_id. Members may invite members; admins may invite either
	// role. Gated on brent:write.
