	RevokeInvitation(context.Context, *connect.Request[sdp_go.RevokeInvitationRequest]) (*connect.Response[sdp_go.RevokeInvitationResponse], error)
	// Removes an active member from a workspace by tombstoning their principal and
	// verified bindings. Refused when it would remove the last active admin. The
